<title>ITALY: Italy September wholesale prices rose 1.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Italy September wholesale prices rose 1.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>National statistics office ISTAT gave the following Italian wholesale price data for September.</p>
<p> WHOLESALE PRICES	 Sept 96     Aug 96     Sept 95</p>
<p> Year/Year change	  +1.3%	+2.0%     +11.6%</p>
<p> Month/Month change	+0.4%	-0.2%	+1.1%</p>
<p> Index (100 in 1990)    133.5	133.0	131.8</p>
</text>
